# Cursor Rules for Scalegraph
#
# This project uses Elixir/OTP with Mnesia for the server, plus a Rust TUI CLI.
# gRPC runs on port 50051 by default.
#
# Tooling and workflow:
# - Version control: JJ (Jujutsu) on top of Git.
# - Task planning/tracking: Beads (bd).
#
# Follow AGENTS.md for required JJ/Beads workflows.
#
# Common commands (from Justfile):
# - just check-env
# - just setup
# - just init
# - just run (server)
# - just cli (Rust TUI)
# - just test / just fmt / just lint
#
# Mnesia data directory:
# - ./priv/mnesia_data
#
# Notes for edits:
# - Prefer Elixir modules in lib/scalegraph/* with clear separation:
#   - ledger (Layer 1), business (Layer 2), smart_contracts (Layer 3).
# - Rust CLI lives in cli/ (build.rs generates gRPC types).
# - MCP server lives in mcp/ (requires running Elixir server).
